cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "qiskitPSTcode: code for Perfect and peak state transfer on IBM quantum hardware"
abstract: >-
  Accompanying code to the paper "Perfect and peak state transfer on IBM
  quantum hardware" by Priscilla Awuah and Krystal Guo. The scripts run
  continuous-time quantum walks with perfect state transfer and peak state
  transfer on IBM Quantum hardware and on the Aer simulator, and produce the
  tables and figures of the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Awuah
    given-names: Priscilla
  - family-names: Guo
    given-names: Krystal
    affiliation: University of Amsterdam
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - quantum walks
  - perfect state transfer
  - peak state transfer
  - Qiskit
  - IBM Quantum
